  "prompt": {
    "full_prompt_text": "integrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] Live-action, cinematic, a medium shot frames a late-night beef-noodle counter from the street side, a steel stockpot steaming under a bare bulb and a row of red plastic stools along the tiled front. Above the serving hatch a neon sign reading \"\u8001\u5f20\u725b\u8089\u9762\" glows in red tube script, mounted flush to the tiled lintel and centred over the hatch. A small radio on the shelf behind the counter plays a Cantonese pop song, a bright synth-backed ballad at a steady mid-tempo, thin and tinny through its single speaker. The camera zooms out with small amplitude at slow speed, opening the frame from the sign to the whole counter. A customer in a grey raincoat, on-screen, thirties, with a low, even tenor and a quick delivery (S1), steps up to the hatch, holds up two fingers toward the cook, and says: <d>[Chinese] \u4e24\u7897\u725b\u8089\u9762\uff0c\u4e00\u7897\u4e0d\u8981\u8fa3\u3002</d> He closes his mouth and lowers his hand to the counter edge. The cook in a white apron behind the stockpot nods once, lifts a ladle, and produces no vocal sound.\n\noverall_soundscape: A stockpot simmers steadily under the hum of a neon transformer. A ladle knocks against steel, a coat sleeve brushes the counter edge, and traffic passes wet and distant on the street behind.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A\n",
